BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 582.1 Tm (PART 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 566.1 Tm (RECEPTIONIST: Lakeside Hotel, good afternoon.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 548.2 Tm (DAVID: Hi, I’d like to book a room. My name is David Clarke, C-L-A-R-K-E.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 530.2 Tm (RECEPTIONIST: How many nights, Mr Clarke?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 512.3 Tm (DAVID: Three nights, arriving on the 18th of June. A double room with a lake view, please.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 494.3 Tm (RECEPTIONIST: That’s £95 a night. Breakfast is served in the garden when the weather is fine,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 478.4 Tm (and parking is £8 a day.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 460.4 Tm (DAVID: Could you also put a bed in the room for my daughter? I’ll pay by card.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 442.5 Tm (RECEPTIONIST: Of course. Your reference number is LH4521.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 424.5 Tm (PART 2) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.0 408.6 Tm (GUIDE: Welcome to the town museum. The building was a bank until 1960. Our favourite exhibit is) Tj ET
